[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2822.069, "timestamp": "00:47:02", "text": "プレイを続けていますか？ いや、いや、いや。 えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2824.23, "timestamp": "00:47:04", "text": "シンガポールですよね？ ええ、私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2825.27, "timestamp": "00:47:05", "text": "シンガポールにいます。 はい、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2833.99, "timestamp": "00:47:13", "text": "皆さんの反応を形にして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2837.109, "timestamp": "00:47:17", "text": "投稿できるような感じです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2839.349, "timestamp": "00:47:19", "text": "ああ、どうぞ、兄弟。   あれが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2842.23, "timestamp": "00:47:22", "text": "乱痴気騒ぎだよ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2844.55, "timestamp": "00:47:24", "text": "最後の３回の鞭打ちは空振りだった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2846.309, "timestamp": "00:47:26", "text": "素晴らしかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2851.829, "timestamp": "00:47:31", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2854.23, "timestamp": "00:47:34", "text": "いや、いや、いや。   来て"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2856.309, "timestamp": "00:47:36", "text": "。 今、後退するな。 いや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2859.27, "timestamp": "00:47:39", "text": "実際、実際、実際。   来て"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2865.27, "timestamp": "00:47:45", "text": "あ、えっと、腕立て伏せの罰ゲームを受けたんです。 やらなきゃいけないことがあるので、ちょっと待ってください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2866.63, "timestamp": "00:47:46", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2868.79, "timestamp": "00:47:48", "text": "ああ、なんてことだ。 いくら？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2871.589, "timestamp": "00:47:51", "text": "5だと思います。 えっと、ちょっと待ってください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2872.39, "timestamp": "00:47:52", "text": "君ならできるよ。"}]